<Positioned left="48" top="1320"><Container width="1104" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="14" border="1 SOLID #E1E7F0" padding="24"><Column crossAxisAlignment="START" mainAxisSize="MIN"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#2563EB" fontStyle="BOLD" letterSpacing="1">请求与响应</Text><SizedBox height="8"/><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="22" color="#334155">每次真实请求都记录 URL、请求体哈希、HTTP 状态、Content-Type 与 X-Request-Id；失败响应同样保留，不能存成图片。</Text></Column></Container></Positioned>
